/*
 * Declares the SliceAccessValue class.
 *
 * SliceAccessValue represents an indexed access on a slice value. The operator
 * applies an index expression to a slice operand and produces the element at
 * the given position. Bounds checking and runtime access semantics are handled
 * by the generator and runtime according to the slice type.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::slice::sliceaccess
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/slice/sliceaccess.yr
